    "chat_subtitle": "We're here to help.",
    "start_chat": "Start Chat",
    "email_us": "Email Us",
    "email_subtitle": "Send an email anytime.",
    "call_us": "Call Us",
    "call_subtitle": "Mon-Fri, 9am–5pm.",
    "follow_us": "FOLLOW US",
    "faq_1_q": "How do I place a food order at a store?",
    "faq_1_a": "Scan the QR code at the merchant's table or counter, select your favourite food items, and complete payment online. You can also place takeaway orders.",
    "faq_2_q": "How do I book community services (Barber, Car Wash, etc)?",
    "faq_2_a": "Open your preferred service store in the Explore tab, select the service package, and choose your preferred date and time. Tap 'Book Now' to confirm your appointment slot.",
    "faq_3_q": "How do I use store discount vouchers?",
    "faq_3_a": "During checkout, tap 'Apply Voucher'. You can select from active store vouchers or enter a valid promo code. The discount will be deducted automatically.",
    "faq_4_q": "What payment methods are supported on Ngam?",
    "faq_4_a": "Ngam supports fast and secure cashless payments via DuitNow QR, Online Banking (FPX), and major Malaysian e-wallets.",
    "faq_5_q": "How do I track my order or queue status?",
    "faq_5_a": "You can track your order live via the Order Status Tracker. You will also receive an instant notification when your order is ready or when your turn arrives.",
    "faq_6_q": "Can I cancel a service booking?",
    "faq_6_a": "Yes, you can cancel or reschedule via the 'My Bookings' screen at least 1 hour prior to your scheduled appointment.",
    "faq_7_q": "What is the Digital Loyalty Stamp Card?",
    "faq_7_a": "Every time you complete an order or service at participating Ngam merchants, you earn a digital stamp to redeem free rewards and perks from that shop.",
    "faq_8_q": "What if my order is incorrect or has an issue?",
    "faq_8_a": "You can notify the merchant staff immediately by showing your digital receipt in the Ngam app, or reach out to our customer support team via 'Contact Us'.",
    "faq_9_q": "Is my personal data and payment secure?",
    "faq_9_a": "Yes, your security is our priority. All transactions and personal details are protected by high-grade encryption (SSL/TLS) and processed through licensed Malaysian payment gateways.",
    "faq_10_q": "How do I register my business as a Ngam Partner?",
    "faq_10_a": "Merchants can register and manage their store by using the Ngam Business app or visiting our official portal at business.ngam.dev."
  },
